-- A set relationship with a dead member and empty fibers. The predicate crossing reports both
-- dead members over X; the effect crossings report only the selected one; an empty fiber under
-- an identityless gamma reports FIBER ... IS EMPTY; and the gamma in effect position reduces
-- over the live members alone.
--! registry fiber-world
--! expect reach = 1 0 0 1 0
--! expect tally = 9 0 0 7 0

|/ targets'.Rich , Tally += 1
Lead , Reach = #/ targets'
Lead , Tally = max/ targets'.Gold
